SUMMARY:ICWSM 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International AAAI Conference on Web and Social Media\nStatus: 
 confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://www.icwsm.org/20
 26/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#icwsm-2026\nNote
 s: 20th ICWSM (AAAI). Main conference May 27-29\, 2026 at the Los Angeles
  Airport Marriott\; workshops and tutorials May 26 at USC ISI. Accepted p
 apers had to be presented in person (Zoom viewing only for developing-cou
 ntry residents). Full-paper rounds closed May 15 and Sep 15\, 2025 and Ja
 n 15\, 2026 at 23:59 AoE\; Round 1 is not stored because only two paper-r
 ound types exist. Posters\, demos (not tracked) and dataset papers used o
 nly the January round. Proposal and notification days carry no explicit h
 our. Social Science and Sociophysics track papers publish abstracts only.
  The official program lists 186 papers (154 full\, 20 dataset\, 8 poster\
 , 4 demo). Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Complex Systems & Network Science,Natural Language Processing & 
 LLMs,Data Mining & Data Science
